  <description>
    <p>Hold TAB in Overwatch and PickGak reads the scoreboard, then suggests what to pick from the enemy team, map, meta, party and bans.</p>
    <p>It never touches the game process: it observes TAB and copies the game window's pixels only while TAB is held.</p>
  </description>
